[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:117. Tommy's Breakfast]
[00:00.660] Lesson 117. | 第117课。
[00:03.945] When my husband was going into the dining-room this morning, he dropped some coins on the floor. | 今天早上我丈夫走进餐厅时，他把一些硬币掉在了地上。
[00:12.580] There were coins everywhere. | 到处都是硬币。
[00:16.000] We looked for them, but we could not find them all. | 我们找了，但没能全部找到。
[00:20.850] While we were having breakfast, our little boy, Tommy, found two small coins on the floor. | 我们吃早饭的时候，我们的小儿子汤米在地上找到了两枚小硬币。
[00:29.380] He put them both into his mouth. | 他把它们都放进了嘴里。
[00:33.190] We both tried to get the coins, but it was too late. | 我们都想把硬币拿出来，但已经太迟了。
[00:38.805] Tommy had already swallowed them. | 汤米已经把它们吞下去了。
[00:42.560] Later that morning, when I was doing the housework, my husband telephoned me from the office. | 那天早上晚些时候，我正在做家务时，我丈夫从办公室给我打了电话。
[00:52.270] "How's Tommy?" he asked. | “汤米怎么样了？”他问。
[00:56.200] "I don't know," I answered. | “我不知道，”我回答。
[00:59.705] "Tommy's been to the lavatory three times this morning, but I haven't had any change yet." | “汤米今天早上已经去厕所三次了，但我还没拿到任何零钱。”